From 561cb039c445da4be38abc468548d461502d0862 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "A.Cervantez" <155030226+Ywach404@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:53:05 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] runtime: both stick clicks reach the game as nothing

Both stick clicks together are the host's: a quick press switches the view and a long hold opens the layout editor. L3 went out at once as the quest log, so opening the editor also opened that screen and left the game in a menu under it. L3 now sends nothing in play (menus and dialogue keep it as the quest log, and the sheet and log stay reachable from the game's own menus), and R3's crouch is let go as L3 joins it.
---
 runtime/input_selftest.c | 77 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 runtime/pad.c            | 24 +++++++++++--
 runtime/pad.h            |  2 +-
 3 files changed, 85 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

diff --git a/runtime/input_selftest.c b/runtime/input_selftest.c
